=== Episode 2: Biscuits ===
The second episode is Biscuit Week.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Middleton |first1=Howard |title=The Great British Bake Off 2025: biscuit week recap |url=https://www.greatbritishchefs.com/features/great-british-bake-off-2025-biscuit-week-recap |website=[[Great British Chefs]] |access-date=11 September 2025 |language=en |date=10 September 2025}}</ref> For the first challenge, the bakers were given two hours to produce twelve Slice and Bake biscuits. For the technical challenge, set by Prue, the bakers were asked to bake in two hours a batch of Chocolate [[Hobnob biscuit|Hobnob]] biscuits, topped with a thin layer of caramel and contain two different feathered chocolate designs. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were asked to make a biscuit time capsule filled with five edible mementos in four hours.
