=== Episode 3: Bread ===
The third episode is Bread Week.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Middleton |first1=Howard |title=The Great British Bake Off 2025: bread week recap |url=https://www.greatbritishchefs.com/features/great-british-bake-off-2025-bread-week-recap |website=[[Great British Chefs]] |access-date=19 September 2025 |language=en |date=17 September 2025}}</ref> For the first challenge, the bakers were given two hours to produce a savoury [[Monkey bread]]. For the technical challenge, set by Paul, the bakers were asked to bake in two hours a dozen glazed [[doughnuts]], six of which containing a strawberry glazing. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were given five hours to make their own celebratory tiered Sweet Bread.
