=== Episode 9: Pâtisserie (Semifinal) ===
The ninth episode is Pâtisserie Week.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Middleton |first1=Howard |title=The Great British Bake Off 2025: meringue week recap |url=https://www.greatbritishchefs.com/features/great-british-bake-off-2025-patisserie-week-recap |website=[[Great British Chefs]] |access-date=4 November 2025 |language=en |date=30 October 2025}}</ref> For the signature challenge, the bakers were given two hours and forty-five minutes to bake twelve cream horns in two different flavors. For the technical challenge, set by Paul, the bakers were asked to bake a framboisier with a fondant rose and a sugar glass dome. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were asked to make a macaron centerpiece depicting something meaningful to them, with an edible structure at least forty-five centimetres high and displaying a minimum of thirty filled macarons.

