=== ''The Great New Year Bake Off'' ===
The Great New Year Bake Off featured eight bakers from past series competing in pairs: Selasi Gbormittah and Val Stones from [[The Great British Bake Off series 7|Series 7]], [[Briony May Williams|Briony Williams]] from [[The Great British Bake Off series 9|Series 9]] and Tasha Stones from [[The Great British Bake Off series 14|Series 14]], Series 9 winner [[Rahul Mandal]] and [[The Great British Bake Off series 12|Series 12]] winner [[Giuseppe Dell'Anno]], and Andy Ryan and Nelly Ghaffar from [[The Great British Bake Off series 15|Series 15]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/tv/reality-tv/a69508345/great-british-bake-off-favourites-return-special-episode/|title=Bake Off fan favourites confirm return for "unexpected" special episode and fans "can't wait"|date=21 November 2025|work=Digital Spy|accessdate=21 November 2025}}</ref>
 
